-- issue #1281: `zzcfg` declares its OWN, unrelated record type also named `Cfg`,
-- whose sole field `fld` is an `Int` -- same name, same field name and index as
-- aacfg's `Cfg`, but a DIFFERENT field TYPE. This is the `Cfg` main.mdk actually
-- imports and constructs.
public export data Cfg = { fld : Int }
